@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Delivery Tracking

actor Customer
participant "Frontend/UI" as UI
participant "Delivery API" as DeliveryAPI
participant "Delivery Service" as DeliveryService
participant "GHN" as GHN
database DB

Customer -> UI : open tracking page
UI -> DeliveryAPI : GET /api/deliveries/:orderId
DeliveryAPI -> DeliveryService : get delivery by order ID
DeliveryService -> DB : query delivery record
DB --> DeliveryService : delivery data
DeliveryService --> DeliveryAPI : delivery status
alt need GHN lookup
  DeliveryAPI -> GHN : fetch provinces/districts/fee/status
  GHN --> DeliveryAPI : shipping data
end
DeliveryAPI --> UI : tracking result
UI --> Customer : render timeline
@enduml
